# Clash of the Eikons choosing only "Put a lore counter on target Saga you control" (CR 122.1, 714.2c). On turn 1 Bot1's The Birth of
# Meletis has one lore counter (chapter I fetched a Plains); Clash puts a second, so chapter II triggers at once and makes a 0/4 Wall
# token - turn 1, two turns before the Saga's own lore counter would. Only a Saga is a legal target: Bot1's Mox Emerald is not.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Birth of Meletis
Clash of the Eikons
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Forest
Forest
Plains
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Birth of Meletis.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Plains)
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Birth of Meletis.Counters.Lore = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clash of the Eikons.Cast
Bot1.Modes(3)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.The Birth of Meletis)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.The Birth of Meletis.Counters.Lore = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Wall Token.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Wall Token.Toughness = 4
